## 🌟 Key Features
- **MobileNetV2 Transfer Learning Engine:** High-performance binary classification (`no_tumor` vs `tumor`)[span_17](start_span)[span_17](end_span)[span_18](start_span)[span_18](end_span).
- **No-Fabrication Guardrail:** Gracefully handles missing model weights and refuses to display fake predictions when un-trained.
- **Intermediate Activation Visualizer:** Extracts and renders intermediate feature maps from convolutional layers.
- **Gemini Multimodal AI Assistant:** Optional integration via `google-genai` SDK for educational visual analysis.
- **Automated Pytest Suite:** Rigorous unit testing for image pipelines and model utilities.

